    Possible errors include GLFW_NOT_INITIALIZED, GLFW_INVALID_ENUM, GLFW_PLATFORM_ERROR and GLFW_FEATURE_UNAVAILABLE (see above).

  Thread safety:
    This function must only be called from the main thread.

  See also:
